{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29949","headline":"赠毛仙翁 · 崔元略","name":"赠毛仙翁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫将凡圣比云泥，椿菌之年本不齐。\n度世无劳大稻米，昇天只用半刀圭。\n人间嗟对黄昏槿，海上闲听碧落鸡。\n旌节行中令引道，便从尘外踏丹梯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔元略","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29949.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29949","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}